sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = Authorized, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>totalCost <Optional>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPreSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    loop Every <Configured sampled Meter Values interval>, the Test System ends the testcase after two MeterValues
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = MeterValuePeriodic, eventType = Updated, sampledValue.context = Sample.Periodic)
        Note right of CS: timestamp: the intervals between the timestamps of the Meter Value messages<br>equal the configured sampled Meter Values interval
        CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
        opt TransactionEventResponse did not contain a totalCost
            CSMS->>CS: CostUpdatedRequest
            Note over CSMS: Validation: (Optional) CostUpdatedRequest<br>transactionId <Generated TransactionId>
            CS-->>CSMS: CostUpdatedResponse
        end
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
